      "seed": 581880354,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1568762282,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790726400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why it is efficient",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why it is efficient",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text-0369",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1344,
      "y": 1801.0,
      "width": 518.04,
      "height": 157.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp-0366"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1292741140,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 228529923,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790726400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• The loop runs at most 16 times, once per bit of integer2,\n   and stops early when no 1 bits are left: multiplying\n   by 10 (1010) takes only 4 passes.\n• Each pass is just a bit test, two shifts and at most\n   one add.\n• Adding integer1 to itself integer2 times would also avoid *,\n   but it can take up to 65,535 passes.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• The loop runs at most 16 times, once per bit of integer2,\n   and stops early when no 1 bits are left: multiplying\n   by 10 (1010) takes only 4 passes.\n• Each pass is just a bit test, two shifts and at most\n   one add.\n• Adding integer1 to itself integer2 times would also avoid *,\n   but it can take up to 65,535 passes.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
