      "text": " 0 x  0 =   0\n 0 x  1 =   0\n 0 x  2 =   0\n...\n 6 x  4 =  24\n 6 x  5 =  30\n 6 x  6 =  36\n...\n10 x  9 =  90\n10 x 10 = 100",
