      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790726400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Row = a (integer1), column = b (integer2); darker = bigger.\nThe outlined cell is the worked example 6 × 5 = 30.\nColumn 0 is all 0: the loop never runs when integer2 is 0.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Row = a (integer1), column = b (integer2); darker = bigger.\nThe outlined cell is the worked example 6 × 5 = 30.\nColumn 0 is all 0: the loop never runs when integer2 is 0.",
